<title>BELGIUM: EU to raise grain import duties.</title>
<headline>EU to raise grain import duties.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union will on Friday raise duties on imports of durum wheat, soft wheat, barley, rye, sorghum and maize, the European Commission said on Thursday.  </p>
